    {
      "source": "Spring Data query methods usually return one or multiple instances of the aggregate root managed by the repository.\nHowever, it might sometimes be desirable to create projections based on certain attributes of those types.\nSpring Data allows modeling dedicated return types, to more selectively retrieve partial views of the managed aggregates.",
      "translation": "Spring Data 查询方法通常返回由仓储管理的聚合根的一个或多个实例。  \n然而，有时可能希望基于这些类型的某些属性创建投影。  \nSpring Data 允许建模专用的返回类型，以更选择性地检索受管聚合的部分视图。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
